  icon: {fileID: 0}
  itemDescription: "Advanced Agricultural & Food Technologies Institute  This institute
    focuses on sustainable agriculture and advanced food technologies. Its mission
    includes improving crop yields through technology, developing precision agriculture
    techniques, and ensuring food security via innovation. Key R&D areas are hydroponics
    and vertical farming, smart farming (IoT and drones in agriculture), plant biotechnology
    (drought-resistant crops), and post-harvest food processing and preservation.
    The institute aligns with national goals to enhance local food production (like
    the Saudi Green Initiative\u2019s farming projects) while using less water and
    land. It aims to modernize agriculture to be more productive and climate-resilient"
